          "text": "Résumé: Observation de points lumineux rouges accompagnés de bruit",
          "text_sha256": "430e0e542f4ccd6efc8a3727a4d6f703f52fd1a4d25a23ebed386fac7c4fddba"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
